    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nugent Auctioneers, 045 865 555, www.nugents.ie now brings Apartment 4 Newtown Square, to the market. This superbly located property offers all the necessary amenities right on the new owner’s doorstep. Number 4 provides bright and spacious accommodation with impressive ceiling height throughout. The true highlight of the property is the large, southwest-facing balcony which provides a generous outdoor space, overlooking the private resident’s communal garden.\r\n \r\nThe apartment comprises two generously sized double bedrooms, one of which benefits from an ensuite, while the second bedroom has convenient dual access to the main bathroom. The property also features a large, open-plan kitchen and living area, flooded with natural light. Newtown Square is a small development of just 20 apartments, ideally positioned in the heart of Blessington, just off Main Street and adjacent to the Town Centre Development. \r\n\r\nA host of local shops and retailers are within easy reach along with all necessary amenities & schooling options, most notably Dunnes Stores, located just 50m away. Local transport links are stone’s throw away on the Main Street with the number 65 Dublin Bus route to Dublin City Centre and the TFI Local Link to Naas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\t\t\t4.43m x 1.48m\t\tHot-press / storage closet off.\r\nKitchen\t\t\t\t5.90m x 2.87m\t\tTiled floor, eye and base units.\r\nSitting Room\t\t\t4.84m x 4.32m\t\tBalcony off\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.31m x 1.74m\t\tWC & WHB, bath, Dual access from hall & bedroom\r\nBedroom 1 \t\t\t4.23m x 2.95m                 Double built in wardrobes, bathroom off\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t4.26m x 2.69m\t\tBuilt in wardrobe, ensuite off \r\nEnsuite\t\t\t\t1.91m x 1.81m\t\tWC & WHB, shower cubicle\r\nBalcony\t\t\t\t4.58m x 3.28m                 Large south west facing decking"
      },
      {
