        "Content": "● BER: D ● c. 78 mtr sq. | c. 839 sq. ft ● Built in 2004 ● Town Centre Location ● Large South Facing Balcony ● High Ceilings ● Close Transport Links ● Secure Underground Parking ● 50m from Dunnes Stores ● 70m From N81/Main Street ● Management Fees €1,950 per annum ● To be Sold with Vacant Possession \r\n● Mains Water ● Mains Sewage   ● Gas Fired Central Heating    ● Electricity"
